[stderr] ## Explicitly excluded or approval-gated work
[stderr] 
[stderr] The delivery map does **not** create account identity, remote saves/sync,
[stderr] multiplayer, moderation/player safety services, live operations, analytics,
[stderr] purchases, or entitlements.  These requests contradict the P0 offline local
[stderr] campaign and require separate product, privacy, security, cost, support, and
[stderr] failure-mode approval.  Exact engine, storage API, host/CDN, diagnostics
[stderr] transport, content-editor format, languages, ratings/parental/regional policy,
[stderr] supported browsers/devices/assistive technology, performance budgets, and
[stderr] service-worker rollout policy remain decision gates—not invented requirements.
