[stderr] +| GAME-003 | GPI-006: four handlers, 20 adjudication fixtures | GPI-001 | Rules + core | Deterministic acceptance/rejection fixtures |
[stderr] +| GAME-004 | GPI-007: selection policy, 8 seeded fixtures | GPI-002–005 | Editorial + core | Repeat/shortage/withdrawal tests |
[stderr] +| GAME-005 | GPI-008: TUT-01–05 fixed tutorial | GPI-001, 006, 013–014 | Design + editorial | Offline completion/resume test |
[stderr] +| GAME-006 | GPI-009: one 10-card Mixed Fixture template | GPI-002–007 | Rules + core | Seeded selection lifecycle |
[stderr] +| GAME-007 | GPI-010: rule table, 12 edge fixtures | GPI-006, 009 | Rules + accessibility | Score/streak equivalent-feedback tests |
[stderr] +| GAME-008 | GPI-011: result and milestone states | GPI-009–010, 014 | Design + UI | Idempotence/recovery lifecycle tests |
[stderr] +| GAME-009 | GPI-012: profile/settings plus four input maps | — | Accessibility + platform | Input and accessibility review |
[stderr] +| GAME-010 | GPI-013: four recovery states, eight faults | GPI-011 | Persistence + accessibility | Fault-injection recovery tests |
[stderr] +| GAME-011 | GPI-014: cache/update notices and six fixtures | GPI-002–005, 013 | Release + platform | Offline/update/error tests |
