[stderr] +| DM-03 | Implement versioned content schema/import validator and immutable package manifest. | DM-01–02; GPI-001 | `src/content/{schema,validator,registry}`; `content/`; `tests/content/` | Valid minimal package passes; one negative fixture per reference/status failure fails. |
[stderr] +| DM-04 | Produce and validate GPI-001 plus all four named Kickoff Mix batches GPI-002–005, including two-review and rights/source records. | DM-03; accepted G evidence | `content/cards/`; `content/provenance/`; `tests/content/editorial.*` | 48-card quota/cap/source/review/locale validator report. |
[stderr] +| DM-05 | Produce and validate TUT-01–05, GPI-008, as a fixed accessible offline tutorial package. | DM-03–04; accepted G evidence | `content/tutorial/`; tutorial fixtures | Every named card resolves and tutorial fixture completes once. |
