ficulty; no club dominates more than 3 cards\",\"original_brief\":\"Balanced factual prompts that avoid celebrity imitation, stereotypes, and ambiguous era claims.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-001\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-QZ-001\",\"ASSET-QZ-002\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-QZ-001\",\"AUDIO-QZ-002\",\"AUDIO-QZ-003\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Third reviewed batch available to standard-round selection.\",\"owner\":\"Editorial lead + two factual reviewers\",\"verification\":\"Validator checks club cap, disambiguated canonical answers, sources, and explanation coverage.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-005\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-002\",\"selected_module\":\"quiz-content-and-editorial-integrity\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"finite editorial catalogue batches\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"QB-A-37\u201348: Records and Tournaments\",\"planned_quantity\":\"12 original cards; 3 each difficulty; at least 4 women\u2019s-football or global-football topics\",\"original_brief\":\"Inclusive, source-checked record and tournament prompts with checked-date metadata.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-001\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-QZ-001\",\"ASSET-QZ-002\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-QZ-001\",\"AUDIO-QZ-002\",\"AUDIO-QZ-003\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Fourth reviewed batch completes the 48-card Kickoff Mix catalogue.\",\"owner\":\"Editorial lead + two factual reviewers\",\"verification\":\"Batch validation checks topical quota, freshness dates, provenance, and no duplicate factual claim.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-006\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-003\",\"selected_module\":\"quiz-content-and-editorial-integrity\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"adjudication rules and fixtures\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"one deterministic normalisation policy with 20 fixtures\",\"planned_quantity\":\"4 format handlers; 20 acceptance/rejection fixtures\",\"original_brief\":\"Normalise only documented Unicode/case/punctuation/space/diacritic variants and authored aliases; never guess.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-001\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-FBK-001\",\"ASSET-FBK-002\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-QZ-002\",\"AUDIO-QZ-003\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Fair answer resolver with explainable result events.\",\"owner\":\"Game rules designer + core engineer\",\"verification\":\"Fixtures cover aliases, blanks, malformed input, ambiguity, outdated facts, and immutable resolved attempts.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-007\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-004\",\"selected_module\":\"quiz-content-and-editorial-integrity\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"repeat ledger and editorial lifecycle\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"one selection policy plus draft/review/published/withdrawn catalogue states\",\"planned_quantity\":\"1 policy; 8 seeded selection fixtures\",\"original_brief\":\"Prioritise variety while excluding the last two completed-round cards when alternatives exist; disclose shortages.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-002\",\"GPI-003\",\"GPI-004\",\"GPI-005\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-OPS-001\"],\"audio_ids\":[],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Versioned content workflow and deterministic anti-repeat selection input.\",\"owner\":\"Editorial lead + core engineer\",\"verification\":\"Seeded runs prove exclusion, shortage disclosure, withdrawal safety, and reproducible selection.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-008\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-005\",\"selected_module\":\"round-score-and-progress-rules\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"tutorial round card set\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"TUT-01\u201305 First Whistle\",\"planned_quantity\":\"5 named fixed cards, non-timed, available offline\",\"original_brief\":\"Teach read/select-or-enter/confirm/result/save in five original questions, with plain-language guidance.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-001\",\"GPI-006\",\"GPI-013\",\"GPI-014\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-SHL-001\",\"ASSET-QZ-001\",\"ASSET-FBK-001\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-MUS-001\",\"AUDIO-QZ-001\",\"AUDIO-QZ-002\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Completable offline onboarding that sets first_whistle_complete once.\",\"owner\":\"Game designer + editorial lead\",\"verification\":\"New profile completes, restarts, resumes, and records one idempotent milestone.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-009\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-006\",\"selected_module\":\"round-score-and-progress-rules\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"standard round rule card\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"Mixed Fixture 10-card template\",\"planned_quantity\":\"1 template; 10-card seeded fixtures\",\"original_brief\":\"Theme-led short session alternates eligible format/difficulty where possible and makes timing optional-off.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-002\",\"GPI-003\",\"GPI-004\",\"GPI-005\",\"GPI-006\",\"GPI-007\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-QZ-001\",\"ASSET-QZ-002\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-MUS-001\",\"AUDIO-QZ-001\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Deterministic, interruptible standard-round lifecycle.\",\"owner\":\"Game rules designer + core engineer\",\"verification\":\"Seed fixtures prove eligibility, alternation/shortage messaging, optional timer, and no mid-round content switch.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-010\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-007\",\"selected_module\":\"round-score-and-progress-rules\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"score and feedback rule table\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"one 100-point base / capped 3+ streak rule table\",\"planned_quantity\":\"1 rule table; 12 edge-case fixtures\",\"original_brief\":\"Make momentum celebratory but recoverable: wrong, blank, timeout, and abandon reset streak without negative score.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-006\",\"GPI-009\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-FBK-001\",\"ASSET-FBK-002\",\"ASSET-FBK-003\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-QZ-002\",\"AUDIO-QZ-003\",\"AUDIO-QZ-004\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Accessible state events for score, streak, correction, and celebration.\",\"owner\":\"Game rules designer + accessibility reviewer\",\"verification\":\"Fixtures prove cap, reset, monotonic total, text/pattern equivalent, reduced-motion and muted outcomes.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-011\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-008\",\"selected_module\":\"round-score-and-progress-rules\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"results and milestone surface\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"one result summary and first_whistle_complete milestone\",\"planned_quantity\":\"2 named states; 6 lifecycle fixtures\",\"original_brief\":\"Show score, streak outcome, next action, and learning-oriented explanation without rank, loot, or social comparison.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-009\",\"GPI-010\",\"GPI-014\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-FBK-004\",\"ASSET-UI-001\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-RES-001\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Idempotent completion state compatible with safe local resume.\",\"owner\":\"Game designer + UI engineer\",\"verification\":\"Complete/reopen, abandon/resume, corrupt draft, and deletion flows preserve one result/milestone.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-012\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-009\",\"selected_module\":\"accessible-recoverable-multitarget-experience\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"guided-start and accessibility action map\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"local profile, tutorial entry, settings, 4 semantic input adapters\",\"planned_quantity\":\"4 mappings: touch, pointer, keyboard, gamepad\",\"original_brief\":\"Every action is labelled and equivalently available; focus, captions, contrast, text scaling, and reduced motion are designed in.\",\"dependencies\":[],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-SHL-001\",\"ASSET-UI-001\",\"ASSET-UI-003\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-SET-001\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Accessible entry and settings foundations for all rounds.\",\"owner\":\"Accessibility lead + platform/UI engineer\",\"verification\":\"Keyboard-only, touch, pointer, unavailable-gamepad, focus restoration, captions, 200% text, and contrast checks.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-013\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-010\",\"selected_module\":\"accessible-recoverable-multitarget-experience\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"snapshot recovery policy and UI states\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"confirmed snapshots, write-failure, corruption, deletion choice set\",\"planned_quantity\":\"4 recovery states; 8 fault fixtures\",\"original_brief\":\"Never silently lose confirmed local progress; explain choices plainly and require confirmation before deletion.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-011\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-UI-003\",\"ASSET-SYS-001\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-SYS-002\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Recoverable revisioned local saves separated from settings.\",\"owner\":\"Persistence engineer + accessibility reviewer\",\"verification\":\"Injected write failure, restart, corruption, migration rejection, and confirmed deletion retain stated invariants.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-014\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-011\",\"selected_module\":\"accessible-recoverable-multitarget-experience\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"offline/update/error communication package\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"cached package, between-round gate, recovery notices\",\"planned_quantity\":\"4 status messages; 6 lifecycle fixtures\",\"original_brief\":\"Offline availability and updates are truthful, plain-language, and never interrupt an active round or save.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-002\",\"GPI-003\",\"GPI-004\",\"GPI-005\",\"GPI-013\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-SYS-001\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-SYS-001\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Safe cache/update/error behaviour with text/icon/pattern/caption equivalents.\",\"owner\":\"Release engineer + platform engineer\",\"verification\":\"Offline first visit, cached play, update mid-round, unavailable content, and diagnostics-denial fixtures.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-015\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-012\",\"selected_module\":\"accessible-recoverable-multitarget-experience\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"platform capability and certification matrix\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"web, PWA, Android, iOS parity matrix\",\"planned_quantity\":\"4 target rows; 1 privacy/store checklist per mobile target\",\"original_brief\":\"Shared fair rules/content/saves with only explicit input, install, layout, orientation, performance, and store adaptations.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-012\",\"GPI-013\",\"GPI-014\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-SHL-001\",\"ASSET-UI-001\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-MUS-001\",\"AUDIO-SET-001\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Target-specific adapter/certification plan that cannot change core adjudication.\",\"owner\":\"Platform lead + release manager\",\"verification\":\"Target matrix demonstrates parity, adaptation rationale, privacy disclosure evidence, and approved budget/store gates.\"}\n   ]\n }\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.md b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..77122256aa75a0ad40d45c873bca06c020db9445\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@\n+# Game production inventory\n+\n+**Source:** `specification/02-game-design-bible.json`. This inventory is the\n+bounded bridge from canonical design units to authored production work. All\n+entries are first-release planned; the bible's rejected modules remain rejected\n+with their recorded reasons. `GPI-*` IDs are stable and map one-to-one or\n+one-to-many to `GAME-*` units.\n+\n+| Design unit | Inventory IDs and finite scope | Dependency | Owner | Verification route |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n+| GAME-001 | GPI-001: one card schema, five format fixtures | \u2014 | Editorial + tooling | Schema/negative fixtures |\n+| GAME-002 | GPI-002\u2013005: four named 12-card batches, QB-A-01\u201348 | GPI-001 | Editorial + two reviewers | Provenance, review, quota, uniqueness validator |\n+| GAME-003 | GPI-006: four handlers, 20 adjudication fixtures | GPI-001 | Rules + core | Deterministic acceptance/rejection fixtures |\n+| GAME-004 | GPI-007: selection policy, 8 seeded fixtures | GPI-002\u2013005 | Editorial + core | Repeat/shortage/withdrawal tests |\n+| GAME-005 | GPI-008: TUT-01\u201305 fixed tutorial | GPI-001, 006, 013\u2013014 | Design + editorial | Offline completion/resume test |\n+| GAME-006 | GPI-009: one 10-card Mixed Fixture template | GPI-002\u2013007 | Rules + core | Seeded selection lifecycle |\n+| GAME-007 | GPI-010: rule table, 12 edge fixtures | GPI-006, 009 | Rules + accessibility | Score/streak equivalent-feedback tests |\n+| GAME-008 | GPI-011: result and milestone states | GPI-009\u2013010, 014 | Design + UI | Idempotence/recovery lifecycle tests |\n+| GAME-009 | GPI-012: profile/settings plus four input maps | \u2014 | Accessibility + platform | Input and accessibility review |\n+| GAME-010 | GPI-013: four recovery states, eight faults | GPI-011 | Persistence + accessibility | Fault-injection recovery tests |\n+| GAME-011 | GPI-014: cache/update notices and six fixtures | GPI-002\u2013005, 013 | Release + platform | Offline/update/error tests |\n+| GAME-012 | GPI-015: four-target parity/certification matrix | GPI-012\u2013014 | Platform + release | Target evidence and certification checklist |\n+\n+The machine-readable [inventory](game-production-inventory.json) is\n+authoritative for each original brief, asset/audio linkage, and verification.\n+All referenced visuals (`ASSET-*`) and cues (`AUDIO-*`) are original-production\n+work: each is reviewed for provenance, non-copying, accessibility equivalence,\n+manifest validity, integration trigger, and runtime fallback before release.\ndiff --git a/runbooks/.supervisor-children/football-trivia-e2e-game-design.json b/runbooks/.supervisor-children/football-trivia-e2e-game-design.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..eb29dc7ac2d956b9e65d21bd99e36972dc81ff0a\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/runbooks/.supervisor-children/football-trivia-e2e-game-design.json\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+{\"runbooks_dir\":\"../projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks\"}\n\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse Failed\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/GD0001.md b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/GD0001.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..acb719d0e08d6b55a3e0b4f2972f4c72a11b0906\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/GD0001.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@\n+---\n+task_id: GD0001\n+sequence: 1\n+dependencies:\n+title: Dispatch bounded football-trivia game-design programme\n+browser_impact: not_applicable\n+playwright_spec:\n+---\n+\n+## Objective\n+\n+Read `../PROJECT_BRIEF.md`, `../INITIAL.md`, `../specification/00-domain-discovery.md`,\n+`../specification/01-game-identity.md`, `../specification/02-game-design-bible.{md,json}`,\n+`../specification/01-creative-direction.md`, and\n+`../planning/game-production-inventory.{md,json}`. Maintain\n+`../planning/game-design-manifest.json` as the completion gate; it starts\n+pending and must not be marked accepted by this dispatcher.\n+\n+Create no more than three bounded GB writers, one per selected module, plus\n+`GC0001.md`. Register each new file's normal Supervisor metadata and output\n+paths. Each GB writer may create at most five focused `G####.md` tasks, and\n+every G task must declare its actual `design_authoring_batch: GB####`.\n+\n+For this football-trivia programme, allocate design evidence for: original\n+question-card grammar and four named QB-A editorial batches with sources and\n+reviews; adjudication/fairness and anti-repeat rules; First Whistle, Mixed\n+Fixture, score/streak/results rules; guided accessibility, recovery/offline,\n+and target parity. G tasks must create/review detailed bibles, not code and not\n+implementation B/R runbooks.\n+\n+`GC0001` must check G ownership, the five-G-per-GB limit, canonical GAME and\n+GPI coverage, dependency closure, original-expression/provenance evidence,\n+asset/audio accessibility equivalents, output quality, and manifest\n+consistency. If any selected module or production entry lacks accepted detailed\n+evidence, create exactly one successor `GD####` dispatcher for the next bounded\n+wave. When all required evidence is accepted, create a final `GQ####` audit.\n+Only that audit may update the canonical bible/inventory and set manifest\n+`status: accepted`, accepted `final_audit`, accepted module entries with output\n+paths/GAME IDs/GPI IDs, and empty pending/blocked arrays after running the\n+dedicated manifest completion check. The implementation-coverage validator is\n+explicitly deferred until F012. Do not create B or R files.\n+\n+## Acceptance criteria\n+\n+- The generated G collection is bounded, batch-owned, and covers every selected module and GPI entry without expanding rejected/decision-gated scope.\n+- `GC0001` and later GD/GQ work provide the required validation, dispatch, and final-audit loop.\n+- The manifest cannot become accepted until durable G evidence, complete module/GAME/GPI coverage, and the dedicated completion check all pass.\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-design-manifest.json b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-design-manifest.json\nindex bd989f4bcfc5bff52a09a9f2342d23c1ed135fb6..4a646b9b834428477cc57c1237c663da1663ae54\n--- a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-design-manifest.json\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-design-manifest.json\n@@ -1,11 +1,11 @@\n {\n-  \"status\": \"accepted\",\n-  \"final_audit\": {\"task_id\": \"G-FT-001\", \"status\": \"accepted\", \"scope\": \"football trivia selected modules only\"},\n-  \"pending_modules\": [],\n+  \"status\": \"pending\",\n+  \"final_audit\": {\"task_id\": null, \"status\": \"pending\"},\n+  \"pending_modules\": [\"quiz-content-and-editorial-integrity\", \"round-score-and-progress-rules\", \"accessible-recoverable-multitarget-experience\"],\n   \"blocked_modules\": [],\n   \"modules\": [\n-    {\"module\":\"quiz-content-and-editorial-integrity\",\"status\":\"accepted\"