selection.\",\"owner\":\"Editorial lead + two factual reviewers\",\"verification\":\"Editorial ledger proves 12 distinct original cards and all source/review/status fields.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-004\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-002\",\"selected_module\":\"quiz-content-and-editorial-integrity\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"finite editorial catalogue batches\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"QB-A-25\u201336: Clubs, Players, and Managers\",\"planned_quantity\":\"12 original cards; 3 each difficulty; no club dominates more than 3 cards\",\"original_brief\":\"Balanced factual prompts that avoid celebrity imitation, stereotypes, and ambiguous era claims.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-001\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-QZ-001\",\"ASSET-QZ-002\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-QZ-001\",\"AUDIO-QZ-002\",\"AUDIO-QZ-003\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Third reviewed batch available to standard-round selection.\",\"owner\":\"Editorial lead + two factual reviewers\",\"verification\":\"Validator checks club cap, disambiguated canonical answers, sources, and explanation coverage.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-005\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-002\",\"selected_module\":\"quiz-content-and-editorial-integrity\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"finite editorial catalogue batches\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"QB-A-37\u201348: Records and Tournaments\",\"planned_quantity\":\"12 original cards; 3 each difficulty; at least 4 women\u2019s-football or global-football topics\",\"original_brief\":\"Inclusive, source-checked record and tournament prompts with checked-date metadata.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-001\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-QZ-001\",\"ASSET-QZ-002\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-QZ-001\",\"AUDIO-QZ-002\",\"AUDIO-QZ-003\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Fourth reviewed batch completes the 48-card Kickoff Mix catalogue.\",\"owner\":\"Editorial lead + two factual reviewers\",\"verification\":\"Batch validation checks topical quota, freshness dates, provenance, and no duplicate factual claim.\"},\n+   