orm engineer\",\"verification\":\"Offline first visit, cached play, update mid-round, unavailable content, and diagnostics-denial fixtures.\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"GPI-015\",\"game_design_id\":\"GAME-012\",\"selected_module\":\"accessible-recoverable-multitarget-experience\",\"content_design_card_type\":\"platform capability and certification matrix\",\"finite_item_or_catalogue_batch\":\"web, PWA, Android, iOS parity matrix\",\"planned_quantity\":\"4 target rows; 1 privacy/store checklist per mobile target\",\"original_brief\":\"Shared fair rules/content/saves with only explicit input, install, layout, orientation, performance, and store adaptations.\",\"dependencies\":[\"GPI-012\",\"GPI-013\",\"GPI-014\"],\"asset_ids\":[\"ASSET-SHL-001\",\"ASSET-UI-001\"],\"audio_ids\":[\"AUDIO-MUS-001\",\"AUDIO-SET-001\"],\"implementation_outcome\":\"Target-specific adapter/certification plan that cannot change core adjudication.\",\"owner\":\"Platform lead + release manager\",\"verification\":\"Target matrix demonstrates parity, adaptation rationale, privacy disclosure evidence, and approved budget/store gates.\"}\n   ]\n }\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.md b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..77122256aa75a0ad40d45c873bca06c020db9445\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@\n+# Game production inventory\n+\n+**Source:** `specification/02-game-design-bible.json`. This inventory is the\n+bounded bridge from canonical design units to authored production work. All\n+entries are first-release planned; the bible's rejected modules remain rejected\n+with their recorded reasons. `GPI-*` IDs are stable and map one-to-one or\n+one-to-many to `GAME-*` units.\n+\n+| Design unit | Inventory IDs and finite scope | Dependency | Owner | Verification route |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --